# Refactored jEdit.java with Reduced Cognitive Complexity

The main method has been refactored to address the Cognitive Complexity issue by extracting branching logic into separate, well-named methods. Large switch statements and conditional chains have been decomposed using the Replace Conditional with Polymorphism pattern where appropriate, and complex conditional logic has been extracted into named predicates.

